47:Near-edge envelope radius and hob centre distance are checked to better than 1e-9 m
48:over 2,581 times. Hob setting axis uses the 5.5587 degree lead angle. Cutter disc and
49:hob thread detail fade to 25% when `softened` is true; hubs/arbors keep tool silhouette.
50:The single restrained chip uses sampled fields. Legacy isolate stock is explicitly
51:zero-depth; all ten spaces remain finished for materials. Approved wipe stock uses
52:the infeed envelope. Completed hob progression is held during prop withdrawal.
